Third-party components
----------------------

The container image includes the embedding model bge-small-en-v1.5
(https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5), Copyright (c) 2022
staoxiao (FlagEmbedding, https://github.com/FlagOpen/FlagEmbedding),
licensed under the MIT License, in the int8 ONNX conversion published at
https://huggingface.co/Xenova/bge-small-en-v1.5. It is downloaded at build
time (scripts/fetch-model.sh), not stored in this repository.

The visitor countries in the analytics come from DB-IP's "IP to Country
Lite" database (https://db-ip.com/db/download/ip-to-country-lite),
Copyright (c) DB-IP.com, licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution
4.0 International License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
The geoip workflow downloads it each month (scripts/geoip-fetch.sh); it is
not stored in this repository or the container image. The analytics page
credits it.

